@startuml internal-flow

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam participantPadding 10
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
  BorderColor #FBC02D
}
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #455A64
  LifeLineBorderColor #607D8B
  ParticipantBorderColor #37474F
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #CFD8DC
}

title Fluxo interno — arquitetura de camadas (endpoint SSE)

participant "Cliente HTTP" as Cliente

box "Camada Web" #EEEEEE
  participant "ImageEditController\n(web)" as Controller
end box

box "Camada de Serviço" #E8F5E9
  participant "ImageEditService\n(service)" as Service
  participant "ImageResizer\n(service)" as Resizer
end box

box "Camada de IA (gateway)" #E3F2FD
  participant "OpenAiRestClientImageEditModel\n(ai)" as Gateway
end box

participant "OpenAI\n/v1/images/edits" as OpenAI

Cliente -> Controller : 1. POST /images/edit/stream\n(multipart: image, Accept: text/event-stream)
Controller -> Controller : 2. cria SseEmitter(timeout=180s)\nenvia 200 OK imediato, abre canal SSE

note over Controller
  Boundary HTTP. Converte MultipartFile em bytes
  e delega ao service. O canal já está 200 antes
  do processamento começar.
end note

Controller -> Cliente : 3. event: status\ndata: {"fase":"recebido"}
Controller -> Service : 4. generateStream(bytes, emitter)

note over Service
  Contrato do service: NUNCA lança exceção.
  Toda falha vira GenerateResult.Err.
end note

Service -> Cliente : 5. event: status\ndata: {"fase":"redimensionando"}
Service -> Resizer : 6. resize(ambiente)
Resizer --> Service : 7. Optional<byte[]> ambienteReduzido (JPEG <= 1536px)

note over Resizer
  Thumbnailator, JPEG 1536px, q0.85.
  Entrada inválida -> Optional.empty() (não lança).
end note

Service -> Service : 8. carrega pedra do disco\n(granito.png via stonePath)

Service -> Cliente : 9. event: status\ndata: {"fase":"enviando_openai"}
Service -> Service : 10. monta ImageEditPrompt\n(EditPrompts.COUNTERTOP + AiImageOptions.defaults()\n+ InputImage[ambiente, pedra])
Service -> Gateway : 11. model.call(prompt)

note over Service, Gateway
  Heartbeat mantém o canal vivo durante a
  chamada bloqueante: event: ping a cada 15s.
end note

loop a cada 15s (enquanto OpenAI responde)
  Service -> Cliente : event: ping
end

Gateway -> Gateway : 12. monta multipart\n(image[0]=ambiente, image[1]=pedra)
Gateway -> OpenAI : 13. POST /v1/images/edits\n(multipart, Bearer)
OpenAI --> Gateway : 14. 200 JSON com data[0].b64_json (+ usage)

note over Gateway
  O gateway LANÇA AiImageException em falha
  (como o Spring AI). Nunca devolve exceção bruta.
  O service traduz isso em GenerateResult.Err.
end note

Gateway -> Gateway : 15. traduz JSON em ImageResponse\n(results, metadata, raw)
Gateway --> Service : 16. retorna ImageResponse
Service -> Service : 17. traduz em GenerateResult.Ok\n(b64, raw, usage, latencyMs)
Service --> Controller : 18. retorna GenerateResult.Ok

Controller -> Cliente : 19. event: done\ndata: {"latency_ms", "custo_brl", "usage"}
Controller -> Cliente : 20. event: imagem\ndata: <base64 PNG puro>
Controller -> Cliente : 21. emitter.complete() — fim do stream

@enduml
